is first year of high school! Can Haibara avoid his previous mistakes, make his way to the top of the school social pyramid, and end up with the girl of his dreams? Or will he be forced to relive three years of solitude as the most hated guy in school? He’ll need all the help he can get in order to succeed, from a workout regimen to online how-to guides, a childhood friend, and plenty of sheer willpower. Watch as Haibara takes a second shot at his teenage years!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)\n\nNote: The first 4 episodes had an advance screening on March 15th, 2026. The start date reflects the start of the regular series broadcasting."},"tags":[{"name":"Age Regression","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":100,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Basketball","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Band","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Restaurant","rank":26,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Haibara's Teenage New Game+","english":"Haibara's Teenage New Game+","native":"灰原くんの強くて青春ニューゲーム","romaji":"Haibara-kun no Tsuyokute Seishun New Game","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"灰原同学重返过去，开启所向无敌的第二轮青春游戏"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"灰原君的青春二周目（NEW GAME+）"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"灰原同學重返過去，開啟所向無敵的第二輪青春遊戲"}]},"trailer":{"id":"MPJrey_y_DU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MPJrey_y_DU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}